WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,710
Wait

2
00:00:00,760 --> 00:00:03,600
Why can’t straw be laid directly on the snow?

3
00:00:03,600 --> 00:00:04,640
The snow is cold

4
00:00:04,640 --> 00:00:06,120
You lie down on it with a layer of straw

5
00:00:06,120 --> 00:00:07,720
The cool air from below is still creeping up

6
00:00:07,720 --> 00:00:10,280
Now there is a tree stand with two layers of branches on the ground, one finger high above the ground.

7
00:00:10,280 --> 00:00:11,680
Then spread the straw on the branches

8
00:00:11,680 --> 00:00:13,840
A person lies on straw with a layer of air underneath

9
00:00:13,840 --> 00:00:20,800
I can't stand the cold air anymore, darling

10
00:00:20,800 --> 00:00:22,360
Such a snow hole

11
00:00:22,360 --> 00:00:24,010
Really able to spend the night

12
00:00:24,010 --> 00:00:25,440
Not only can you stay overnight

13
00:00:25,440 --> 00:00:26,880
When the fire is lit, you will feel

14
00:00:26,880 --> 00:00:29,040
This place is better than your old wooden house with a brazier

15
00:00:29,040 --> 00:00:29,960
And warm

16
00:00:29,960 --> 00:00:32,500
I can't light a fire until I have time.

17
00:00:32,500 --> 00:00:35,900
This is a snow cave, the roof has collapsed

18
00:00:35,900 --> 00:00:39,740
The three of us will be buried alive in this pit, right? Brother Mouchuan is like a snow arrow or a fire.

19
00:00:39,740 --> 00:00:43,980
After all, even a three-year-old child understands this. Sit down and relax.

20
00:00:43,980 --> 00:00:44,980
I have my own rules
